    "detailed_description": "Lottery Winner is a simulation game about buying lottery. You can experience spending money buying as much lottery as you want and test if you are lucky to win the first prize.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience lottery games from 2 countries</h2>China<br>Including <strong>Super Lottery</strong> and <strong>7 Star Lottery Game</strong><br><br>Australia<br>Including <strong>Powerball</strong> and <strong>OZ Lotto</strong><br><br>The game has the same design, rule and prize as they are in real life.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy as much lottery as you want!</h2>If you ever imagined you could win a first prize of a lottery, why not try to test your luck in the game with 0 cost?<br>In the game, you could choose infinite mode to withdraw unlimited money from the bank. So that you can buy any lottery at any amount.<br>This is a fun way to examine your math theory or just your luck.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Statistic</h2>Inside game statistic will tell you how much you spend and how much you win in total. You can also check the prize infomation in the result.",
